Done: PR #85 merged (1b47f57), approved by devin after the rebase onto #83.

Acceptance met (`tests/test_tools_github.py`):

* cancelling during `github_checks` returns at the next one-second slice (`test_checks_stop_on_cancel_within_one_slice`);
* at the budget it returns the last state with a note;
* the run-bound wrapper clamps 900 s to the remaining budget and sees both cancel and the deadline.
